## 2. System Architecture

### Service Topology

| Service | Name | Runtime | URL |
|---|---|---|---|
| API Server | `openclaw-api` | Node.js (Express 5) | `openclaw-api-k30t.onrender.com` |
| Frontend | `openclaw-saas` | React + Vite (Static) | Render static |
| Benchmark + ZOA + Kairos | `openclaw-benchmark` | Python (FastAPI) | `openclaw-benchmark.onrender.com` |
| Archon Factory | `archon-factory` | Node.js | `archon-factory.onrender.com` |
| Database | `openclaw-db` | PostgreSQL | Render free |
| Per-tenant Gateway | `openclaw-gateway-{id}` | Docker | Dynamic, per tenant |

### Monorepo Layout

```
openclaw-saas/
├── artifacts/api-server/          # Express 5 API
├── artifacts/openclaw-saas/       # React + Vite frontend
├── lib/db/                        # Drizzle ORM + 28-table schema
├── lib/api-spec/                  # OpenAPI + Orval codegen
├── lib/api-client-react/          # Generated React Query hooks
├── lib/skill-contract/            # Skill interface types
├── lib/gateway-provisioner/       # Render Deploy API client
├── packages/archon/               # Archon workflow YAML
└── packages/archon-factory/       # Skill generation pipeline
```

### Infrastructure Layer Model

```
TENANT LAYER        Auth · Billing · Permissions · Isolation
AGENT RUNTIME       Start/Stop · Gateway Proxy · Chat · History
SKILL BUS           Registry · Install · Benchmark gate · Connector check
KNOWLEDGE GRAPH BUS Create · Ingest · Bind to skills · Full-text search
PLAYBOOK ENGINE     Ordered skill chain + graph bindings + state passing
CONNECTOR REGISTRY  CRM · Email · Slack · LinkedIn · Databases · APIs
```

