## 4. Skill Contract

Every skill MUST implement:

```typescript
interface Skill<TInput = Record<string, unknown>> {
  id: string;                    // "ir-research-v1"
  name: string;
  version: string;
  category: SkillCategory;       // RESEARCH | GENERATE | VALIDATE | SEND | ANALYZE | TRANSFORM | ENRICH
  description: string;
  inputs: object;                // JSON Schema
  outputs: object;               // JSON Schema
  requiredConnectors: string[];
  requiredGraphs: string[];
  execute: (input: TInput, ctx: SkillContext) => Promise<SkillOutput>;
}
```

`SkillOutput` always returns `{ success, data, metadata?, error? }` — never throws.

### Skill Installation Flow

1. Check required connectors authorized
2. Check required graphs exist
3. Run benchmark gate (CERTIFIED or CONDITIONAL to pass)
4. Skill appears in agent's tool palette

### Vertical = Skill Bundle

```
Legal Bundle v1.0
├── clause-extractor.skill.ts
├── intake-router.skill.ts
├── contract-analyst.skill.ts
├── graphs/cuad-legal-clauses.graph
├── connectors/openrouter.connector
└── playbooks/legal-workflow.playbook
```

