## 5. Model Forge

### Training Job State Machine

```
draft → queued → running → completed → deployed
                         ↘ failed
```

### Key Routes

```
POST /forge/workspaces                              Create workspace (auto-provisions tenant)
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/datasets                Create dataset
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/datasets/:did/version   Snapshot version
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs                    Create job
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/submit        Validate + queue
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/dispatch      Dispatch to Kairos
GET  /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/events        SSE stream
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/registry/:rid/versions/:vid/approve  Human approval gate
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/deploy        Deploy approved model
```

### Governance Policy (enforced at submit)

```typescript
{
  allowed_base_models: string[],
  max_dataset_bytes: number,        // default 100MB
  max_concurrent_jobs: number,      // default 2
  deployment_requires_approval: boolean,  // default true
  budget_limit_usd: number | null,
}
```

### Onboarding Provision

`POST /api/onboarding/provision` — idempotent. Seeds starter workspace with:
- CUAD Legal Clause Dataset v2 (50 examples, status: ready)
- Legal Clause Extractor v1 (rag_adaptation, status: completed)
- Approved model version (eval_accuracy: 1.0)
- Active deployment at `/v1/legal/extract-clause`

