## 6. Execution Engines

### ZOA — Multi-LLM Router

| Role | Model |
|---|---|
| MANAGER | `meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free` |
| WORKER: Research | `qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct:free` |
| WORKER: Reasoning | `nousresearch/hermes-3-llama-3.1-405b:free` |
| WORKER: Vision | `google/gemma-3-27b-it:free` |
| WORKER: Write | `cognitivecomputations/dolphin-mistral-24b-venice-edition:free` |
| PLUMBER: Short | `liquid/lfm-2.5-1.2b-instruct:free` |
| PLUMBER: Long | `meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct:free` |

All calls: `provider: { sort: 'throughput', allow_fallbacks: true }`

### Archon — Skill Generation

Pipeline: `prompt → generate (Qwen3 Coder 480B) → L0 validate (tsc) → fix loop (max 2) → L1-L4 benchmark → catalog`

Trigger: `POST /archon/generate { "description": "..." }`

### Kairos — Training Execution

```typescript
kairosClient.runWorkflow({ skill_id, goal, tenant_id, max_turns })
kairosClient.getRunStatus(runId)
kairosClient.getRunStreamUrl(runId)  // SSE
```

Base: `KAIROS_SERVICE_URL/api/v1/zoa/kairos`

