## 7. Governance Layer

**Every AI output carries a governance envelope. Always. No exceptions.**

```json
{
  "governance": {
    "human_review_required": true,
    "privilege_warning": "This output is not legal advice. Review by licensed counsel required.",
    "not_legal_advice": true,
    "escalation_flag": false,
    "jurisdiction_scope": ["US", "EU"]
  },
  "trace": {
    "retrieval_used": true,
    "fallback_used": false,
    "model_used": "openai/gpt-oss-20b:free",
    "latency_ms": 1240,
    "usage_event_id": "uuid-v4"
  },
  "lineage": {
    "asset_version": "v1",
    "dataset_version": "v2",
    "eval_run": "legal-clause-extraction-v2",
    "model_eval_accuracy": 1.0
  }
}
```

`human_review_required` is ALWAYS `true`. `escalation_flag` strengthens the warning when confidence < 0.70 — it does not create it.

