## 8. Legal Vertical (Proof-of-Concept)

### Live Endpoints

```
POST /api/v1/legal/extract-clause    Clause classification (5 types)
POST /api/v1/legal/intake            Matter routing
POST /api/v1/legal/contract/analyze  Contract specialist
POST /api/v1/legal/litigation/analyze
POST /api/v1/legal/ip/analyze
POST /api/v1/legal/employment/analyze
POST /api/v1/legal/corporate/analyze
```

### Model Chain

```
1. openai/gpt-oss-20b:free    (100% accuracy, no RAG needed)
2. openai/gpt-oss-120b:free   (100% accuracy, fallback on 429)
3. liquid/lfm-2.5-1.2b:free   (90% zero-shot, 100% with RAG, fallback on 429)
```

### Eval Results (CUAD v2, n=10, 2026-05-15)

- gpt-oss-20b: 100% accuracy, 1.000 macro-F1, 3.44s
- lfm-1.2b + RAG: 100% accuracy, 1.000 macro-F1, 0.54s
- Held-out (n=40): 92.5% accuracy — promising, NOT production-ready

### Playbook Results

- v1: 9/10 pass, presence_pass_rate=1.0
- v2: 6/10 pass, correctness_pass_rate=0.75
- Gaps: S4 (intake calibration), S6 (employment escalation), S10 (privilege detection)

